er-benefits__wrapper\">\n\n    <div class=\"desceci-powder-benefits__heading\">\n      <p class=\"desceci-powder-benefits__eyebrow\">\n        WHY CHOOSE DESCECI\n      </p>\n\n      <h2>\n        Reliable DTF Powder for Strong, Durable Transfers\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        DESCECI DTF Hot Melt Powder is designed to create even adhesion, smooth transfer performance, and dependable results across everyday production.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"desceci-powder-benefits__grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-powder-benefit\">\n        <strong>Strong Adhesion</strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Helps bond printed designs securely to garments during the heat pressing process.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-powder-benefit\">\n        <strong>Even Melting</strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Supports consistent melting and powder coverage when properly cured.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-powder-benefit\">\n        <strong>Soft Hand Feel</strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Designed to help create comfortable transfers with a smooth finish on apparel.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
