      "name": "Who Is DTF Powder For?",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .desceci-powder-audience {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 76px 20px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-powder-audience__wrapper {\n    max-width: 1180px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-powder-audience__heading {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto 40px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-powder-audience__eyebrow {\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n    color: #5c9143;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1.6px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-powder-audience__heading h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 15px;\n    color: #15243a;\n    font-size: 36px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-powder-audience__heading p {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #697586;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-powder-audience__list {\n    border-top: 1px solid #dfe6eb;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-powder-audience__item {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 28% 1fr auto;\n    gap: 30px;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 25px 8px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe6eb;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-powder-audience__item h3 {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #15243a;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-powder-audience__item p {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #697586;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n  }\n\n  .desceci-powder-audience__arrow {\n    color: #5c9143;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 700px) {\n    .desceci-powder-audience {\n      padding: 55px 18px;\n    }\n\n    .desceci-powder-audience__heading h2 {\n      font-size: 29px;\n    }\n\n    .desceci-powder-audience__heading p {\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .desceci-powder-audience__item {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 22px 3px;\n    }\n\n    .desceci-powder-audience__item p {\n      grid-column: 1 / 2;\n    }\n\n    .desceci-powder-audience__arrow {\n      grid-column: 2 / 3;\n      grid-row: 1 / 3;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"desceci-powder-audience\">\n  <div class=\"desceci-powder-audience__wrapper\">\n\n    <div class=\"desceci-powder-audience__heading\">\n      <p class=\"desceci-powder-audience__eyebrow\">\n        MADE FOR YOUR WORKFLOW\n      </p>\n\n      <h2>\n        Who Is This DTF Powder For?\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        From first-time users to daily production teams, DESCECI DTF Powder supports a range of printing workflows.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"desceci-powder-audience__list\">\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-powder-audience__item\">\n        <h3>DTF Beginners</h3>\n\n        <p>\n          A practical choice for creators learning how powder, curing, and heat pressing work together.\n        </p>\n\n        <span class=\"desceci-powder-audience__arrow\">→</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-powder-audience__item\">\n        <h3>Custom Apparel Businesses</h3>\n\n        <p>\n          Helps support repeat orders for shirts, hoodies, uniforms, and branded merchandise.\n        </p>\n\n        <span class=\"desceci-powder-audience__arrow\">→</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"desceci-powder-audience__item\">\n        <h3>Print Shops & Production Teams</h3>\n\n        <p>\n          Designed for customers who need reliable powder coverage and consistent production results.\n        </p>\n\n        <span class=\"desceci-powder-audience__arrow\">→</span>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
